  23 00026 6751         LCD             /COMMAND TO CONTROLLER
  24 00027 7201         CLA IAC         /TO SET SECTOR AND TRACK TO 1
  25 00030 4053         JMS     LOAD    /SECTOR TO CONTROLLER, LEAVES AC ALONE
  26 00031 4053         JMS     LOAD    /AND TRACK
  27 00032 7104         CLL RAL         /LEAVING A 2 IN AC
