  50            /  FOLLOWING CODE SAME AS OLD PRIMARY BOOT
  51            /
  52 00047 4053         JMS     LOAD    /GRAB NEXT ITEM FROM SILO
  53 00050 3002         DCA     2       /TRADITION; SECONDARY BOOT STARTS LOADING AT 2 !
  54 00051 2050         ISZ     50      /INCREMENT LOAD ADDRESS
  55 00052 5047         JMP     47      /GO BACK FOR ANOTHER
