  59            /
  60 00053 0000 LOAD,   0               /SUBROUTINE TO GIVE AND TAKE DATA FROM CONTROLLER
  61 00054 6753         STR             /IS HE READY TO TALK TO US?
  62 00055 5033         JMP XSTRT       /NO, IS HE PERHAPS DONE WITH SILO, OR IN ERROR?
  63 00056 6752         XDR             /YES, DATA IN OR OUT;IF DATA TO CONTROLLER, AC UNCHANGED
  64 00057 5453         JMP I   LOAD    /NO MAGIC, JUST EXIT FROM SUBROUTINE
